11	 * the upper-cased first three letters of the city, LAST3 the upper-cased first three letters of
12	 * lastName and NNNN a per-city 4-digit zero-padded sequence equal to one more than the number of
13	 * owners already in that city (e.g. {@code SYD-SMI-0007}). Runs after {@link BuildOwner} builds the
